@* A section RCL does NOT inherit the host's Views/_ViewImports.cshtml. Omitting a line
   here ships broken markup with a green build and no runtime error — see design §1/§2.
   Guarded by GuidePageRenderTests (step 12). No @inject IStringLocalizer: Guide has no
   resource set at all and GuideArchitectureTests pins that structurally (step 3b). *@
@using Humans.Guide
@using Humans.Guide.Controllers
@using Humans.Guide.Models
@using Humans.Base
@addTagHelper *, Microsoft.AspNetCore.Mvc.TagHelpers
@* authorize-policy on the refresh form is Humans.UI's AuthorizeViewTagHelper: a section can
   only addTagHelper against Humans.UI, and a Shell-resident helper would render inert (step 6). *@
@addTagHelper *, Humans.Base
